Read Visio connection points (libvisio 0.1.11 parses but drops them).

- .vss/.vsd: rows of chunk 0x99 (X, Y, DirX, DirY; each a type byte and a double)
- .vssx/.vsdx: <Section N="Connection"> rows with X and Y cells
Points are transformed to page coordinates like geometry and handed to the painter
as the "libvisio:connection-points" property list vector of startPage().
Applied by scripts/build-wasm.sh.

